# =============================================================================
# Anki add-on — NEVER commit user data or secrets
# =============================================================================
# Anki stores *live*, per-user add-on settings in meta.json, which includes the
# API keys entered in Preferences. config.json (committed) is only the DEFAULTS
# template and must never hold real credentials.
meta.json
meta.json.bak

# Local history of applied edits (contains card text from your collection).
revert_log.json

# Built packages (see build.py) and any local installs
*.ankiaddon
*.zip
*.xpi

